{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23565","headline":"夜泛阳坞入明月湾即事寄崔湖州 · 白居易","name":"夜泛阳坞入明月湾即事寄崔湖州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖山处处好淹留，最爱东湾北坞头。\n掩映橘林千点火，泓澄潭水一盆油。\n龙头画舸衔明月，鹊脚红旗蘸碧流。\n爲报茶山崔太守，与君各是一家游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}